            "review_title": "Review at Le Sisters",
            "review_text": "Bobstar M\nNha Trang, Vietnam166 contributions\n0\nAmazing food and staff.\nAug 2019 • Friends\nNew place and found by chance as there is a street market out front. Wondered in and Wow the service from the staff was exceptional and spoke very good English. Quality of the meals are amazing for the prices. We had a great mix of both western and Vietnamese foods and we were all very very happy with a generous size of the meals and the flavours that flowed from the food and the cold drinks to enjoy.I have returned and will go again as this is one of my new favourite places to eat, comfortable and cool. Highly recommend. Keep up the great food.\nRead more\nWritten August 8, 2019",
